%% Event architecture — adopted owner-amended baseline; unresolved parameters remain in the Open Decisions register.
flowchart TD
  Command[Validated command / expected version] --> Tx[Owning application transaction]
  Tx --> State[(Domain state)]
  Tx --> Outbox[(Outbox event)]
  Outbox --> Dispatch[Leased dispatcher / at-least-once delivery]
  Dispatch --> Consumer[Consumer validates version / sequence]
  Consumer --> Inbox[(Inbox deduplication)]
  Consumer --> Effect[Atomic local effect + next outbox]
  Consumer --> Retry[Bounded retry / dependency wait]
  Retry --> Consumer
  Retry --> Dead[Dead-letter / audited redrive]
  Effect --> External[Persisted external intent when needed]
  External --> Adapter[Paper submit / query reconciliation]
  Trace[Correlation / causation / aggregate version] -.-> Outbox

  Control[Control / qualification generation changes] --> Tx
  Regime[Regime snapshot published] --> Tx
